---
const demoBase = '/demo/?corpus=epstein-files-1';
const evalAnalysisHref = '/demo/eval?corpus=epstein-files-1&subtab=analysis';
const rerankerStudioHref = '/demo/rag?corpus=epstein-files-1&subtab=learning-ranker';
const agentStudioHref = '/demo/rag?corpus=epstein-files-1&subtab=learning-agent';
---
<section id="demo" class="min-h-screen w-full max-w-[100vw] overflow-x-hidden bg-[#09090b] pt-24 pb-12">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full min-w-0 max-w-7xl px-4">
    <div class="mb-10 w-full min-w-0 text-center">
      <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#39404d] bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(17,24,39,0.92),rgba(15,23,42,0.82))] px-3 py-2 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#cbd5e1] shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.28)] sm:inline-flex sm:w-auto sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:rounded-full sm:px-4 sm:text-[11px] sm:tracking-[0.24em]">
        <span class="rounded-full bg-[#d4b17a] px-2 py-0.5 text-[#17120c]">Featured</span>
        <span>One platform. Full AI stack.</span>
        <span class="hidden md:inline text-[#64748b]">•</span>
        <span class="text-[#94a3b8]">Guided deployment + expert workbench</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
        rag<span class="text-[#64748b]">weld</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 w-full max-w-2xl break-words text-xl text-gray-400">
        The complete, self-hosted AI platform for retrieval and agent systems.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 w-full max-w-3xl break-words text-base leading-relaxed text-[#d4d4d8]">
        Stop researching and wiring together model gateways, document pipelines, vector and graph stores, evals,
        training, tracing, and observability. Ragweld packages the stack into one opinionated workbench.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-2 w-full max-w-3xl break-words text-gray-500">
        Built for AI consultancies that need a repeatable platform for SMB deployments—and RAG power users who
        still want every layer inspectable.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:gap-4">
        <a
          href={demoBase}
          class="w-full rounded-lg bg-[#d4b17a] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-[#17120c] shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.28)] transition-colors hover:bg-[#e8c691] sm:w-auto"
        >
          Launch live demo
        </a>
        <a
          href={evalAnalysisHref}
          class="w-full rounded-lg border border-[#4b5563] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#18181b] sm:w-auto"
        >
          Open eval analysis
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://dmontgomery40.github.io/ragweld/latest/configuration/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full rounded-lg border border-[#27272a] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#18181b] sm:w-auto"
        >
          Docs
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/DMontgomery40/ragweld"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="w-full rounded-lg border border-[#27272a] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#18181b] sm:w-auto"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Feature pills -->
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-3 mb-8 flex-wrap">
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Complete AI stack
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        MCP integration
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Synthetic Data Lab
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Benchmarks + Evals
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Eval Drilldowns
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Run Diffs + Analysis
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Dual training studios
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Tracing + Grafana
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Webhooks + Alerts
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Semantic cache + Recall gates
      </span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#18181b] text-[#94a3b8] text-sm border border-[#27272a]">
        Model routing + catalog
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#252b36] bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,17,24,0.98),rgba(11,18,32,0.92))] p-5 shadow-[0_24px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.28)]">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#9fb2d1]">Start with the proof</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-white">The strongest product story is inside the live workbench.</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#aab4c3]">
            Jump straight into the surfaces that matter: the top-level workbench, the eval comparison flow, and both training studios.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
          <a href={demoBase} class="rounded-xl border border-[#364152] bg-[#111827] px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#64748b] hover:bg-[#162033]">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#7f95b8]">Workbench</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Live demo shell</div>
          </a>
          <a href={evalAnalysisHref} class="rounded-xl border border-[#364152] bg-[#111827] px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#64748b] hover:bg-[#162033]">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#7f95b8]">Evals</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-white">AI run analysis</div>
          </a>
          <a href={rerankerStudioHref} class="rounded-xl border border-[#364152] bg-[#111827] px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#64748b] hover:bg-[#162033]">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#7f95b8]">Studio</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Reranker training</div>
          </a>
          <a href={agentStudioHref} class="rounded-xl border border-[#364152] bg-[#111827] px-4 py-3 text-left transition-colors hover:border-[#64748b] hover:bg-[#162033]">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#7f95b8]">Studio</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Agent training</div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.7fr)_minmax(300px,0.7fr)] lg:items-stretch">
      <!-- Demo iframe container -->
      <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-[#27272a] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-black/50 bg-[#0f0f12]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-3 bg-[#0f0f12] border-b border-[#27272a]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f56]"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#ffbd2e]"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#27c93f]"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="ml-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">Featured workbench demo</span>
            <span class="hidden md:inline rounded-full border border-[#39404d] bg-[#111827] px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#9fb2d1]">
              Live surface
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <a
                href={demoBase}
                class="rounded-md border border-[#27272a] px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-white hover:bg-[#18181b] transition-colors"
              >
                Epstein Files 1
              </a>
            </div>
            <a
              href={demoBase}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="rounded-md border border-[#27272a] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-white hover:bg-[#18181b] transition-colors"
            >
              Try fullscreen
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-scale-wrapper">
          <iframe
            title="ragweld Demo"
            src={demoBase}
            loading="lazy"
            class="demo-iframe border-0"
            sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside
        class="group flex h-full flex-col justify-between rounded-xl border border-[#3a2f22] bg-[linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(26,20,12,0.98),rgba(15,15,18,0.98))] p-6 text-left shadow-[0_20px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.28)] transition-all hover:border-[#6f5938] hover:shadow-[0_24px_90px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#d4b17a]">Separate live calculator</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Crucible</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#e3cfaa]">
            Training cost calculator for GPU fit, wall-clock range, and spend before you burn the credits.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#cbbda2]">
            It lives on its own surface at <span class="font-medium text-[#f3d39c]">/crucible</span>, separate from the main ragweld demo.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-[#4b3b27] bg-[#130f0b] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#f6dfb8]">GPU fit</div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-[#4b3b27] bg-[#130f0b] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#f6dfb8]">Wall-clock range</div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-[#4b3b27] bg-[#130f0b] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#f6dfb8]">Training spend</div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <a
            href="/crucible/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#5a472e] bg-[#17120c] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#f3d39c] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#8a6d45] group-hover:text-[#ffe2b4]"
          >
            <span>Open Crucible</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#9f8a66]">Live on ragweld.com</span>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <style>
      /* Render the iframe at a larger internal viewport, then scale down
         so the demo UI looks "zoomed out" and the dock isn't cramped. */
      .demo-scale-wrapper {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
        /* Ultrawide ratio — matches the demo's actual content height after scaling */
        aspect-ratio: 21 / 9;
      }

      .demo-iframe {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        /* Render at ~143% of container → effective ~1830px at max-w-7xl.
           Then scale(0.7) shrinks it back to fit, giving a "zoomed out" look. */
        width: 142.857%;
        height: 142.857%;
        transform: scale(0.7);
        transform-origin: top left;
      }

      /* Slightly less aggressive zoom on smaller screens */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .demo-iframe {
          width: 125%;
          height: 125%;
          transform: scale(0.8);
        }
      }
    </style>

    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
      <span>Live search + chat are backed by the Epstein Files 1 corpus.</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-[#27272a]">•</span>
      <span>Use <span class="text-gray-400">?mock=1</span> for offline demo mode.</span>
      <span class="hidden md:inline text-[#27272a]">•</span>
      <span>Deep links: <a href={evalAnalysisHref} class="text-[#cbd5e1] hover:text-white transition-colors">eval analysis</a> · <a href={rerankerStudioHref} class="text-[#cbd5e1] hover:text-white transition-colors">reranker studio</a> · <a href={agentStudioHref} class="text-[#cbd5e1] hover:text-white transition-colors">agent studio</a></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
